  <name>Gnomodoro</name>
  <summary>A simple Pomodoro timer for GNOME</summary>
  
  <description>
    <p>
      Gnomodoro is a simple and elegant Pomodoro timer application designed for the GNOME desktop environment.
      It helps you manage your time using the Pomodoro Technique, which breaks work into intervals separated by short breaks.
    </p>
    <p>Features:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Customizable work and break intervals</li>
      <li>Desktop notifications when sessions complete</li>
      <li>Task management to track what you're working on</li>
      <li>Statistics to visualize your productivity</li>
      <li>Light and dark theme support</li>
      <li>Clean and intuitive user interface</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
  
